Tool
$AUTHOR: JCzypie

$NAME: Hot Red Balloon
$ID: mint_hotredballoon
$DESCRIPTION1: Lowers Gravity when held
$DESCRIPTION2: Also increases life regen when held

"STYLE: Knife
#TIER: 3
